            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 11.6. For the purpose of determination of vacations, a Service, Engineering and Construction, Supply and Transportation (Formerly Plant) Department employee in one area, while working temporarily in another area, shall, for the purposes of this Section, be deemed to be an employee in the area in which he/she is regularly employed, and that any employee whose work may not be confined to one area only, shall for the purpose of this Section, be deemed to be an employee in the area in which he/she has his/her headquarters.",
