        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 12.1. If an employee, after commencing work, becomes sick on the job during the first half of a day or tour and works at least one hour of that half day or tour, the employee shall be paid for the remaining portion of that half day or half tour, or who becomes sick on the job after commencing work for the second half of a day or tour and works at least one hour of that second half day or tour, the employee shall be paid for the remaining portion of that half day or half tour. The Company and the Union agree that claim for payment of this benefit contrary to its intent, shall constitute reason for appropriate disciplinary action.",
